# UPB - Prediction Markets - Descriptive Analysis

Set up a python venv and install requirements with the following commands or use VS Code to make it much more user friendly.

```python
python -m venv ./.venv # Setup venv
source <venv>/bin/activate # Activate environment
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt # Install dependencies
```


## Collecting raw data

Adjust the amount of collected pages according to the requirements.

```python
python collect_prediction_markets.py --out ./raw --exclude-kalshi-combos --max-pages 1000
```


## Merging and deduplicating to parquet

```python
python build_market_parquet.py --input ./raw --output ./analysis/data.parquet
```


## Run analysis

```python
python analyze_parquet_data.py
```

